From 8dfaea6216adeafe725dc6a090e6d65702aefc5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zack <huixindaddy@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 02:44:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] CI runs tests only; Workers Builds deploys the testing Worker

GitHub Actions now runs lint and unit tests for pull requests and for
pushes to staging and main. The deploy job and its Cloudflare secrets are
gone.

scripts/ci/cf-build.sh is the Workers Builds build command: it builds
with the mode's switches (testing: sample media and dashboard copy on)
and runs the cf dry run, which stops unless the Worker name, mode and
account are the expected ones. scripts/ci/cf-deploy.sh is the deploy
command: it repeats the dry run and checks, deploys with cf and checks
that the new version serves all traffic.
